{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14228","headline":"夏夜宿表兄话旧 · 窦叔向","name":"夏夜宿表兄话旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜合花开香满庭，夜深微雨醉初醒。\n远书珍重何曾达，旧事凄凉不可听。\n去日儿童皆长大，昔年亲友半凋零。\n明朝又是孤舟别，愁见河桥酒幔青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦叔向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}